WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.500
Hi, everyone.

2
00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.940
I am Mrs. Maslowski. A lot of you already
know me.

3
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:12.980
I wanted to come on here to just explain a
little bit about

4
00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:17.840
The Brightside Project. So The Brightside
Project is a

5
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:22.340
project we have been working on in my
digital literacy class where

6
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:27.040
a bunch of your peers and your friends,
they get to

7
00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.560
post content that makes them happy.

8
00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:34.420
They get to post things that they think
you will all enjoy as fifth grade

9
00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:35.420
