10
00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:40.540
And we all made content to hopefully help
you guys find a bright spot in

11
00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.280
your day on this website. So my
encouragement is to

12
00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:50.220
try to use The Brightside Project website
in the morning or

13
00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:54.460
when you are having big feelings or when
you are

14
00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:57.220
