15
00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:59.940
It's a nice way to have students connect.

16
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:05.360
It's a nice way to find new friends, new
hobbies, new things that make

17
00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:10.300
