friends.

31
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.640
So if you have any questions, please reach
out.

32
00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:07.340
And we are so excited to make Roy-Hart
Middle School for the fifth

33
00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:10.220
